on exitFrame
  [  0] pushsymb 80 ............................. <#stop>
  [  2] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  4] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <1>
  [  6] extcall 81 .............................. sound stop 1
  [  8] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [ 10] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 12] get 4 ................................... <the volume of sound 2>
  [ 14] setlocal 0 .............................. volym = the volume of sound 2
  [ 16] getlocal 0 .............................. <volym>
  [ 18] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 19] gt ...................................... <volym > 0>
  [ 20] jmpifz [ 50] ............................ repeat while volym > 0
  [ 23] getlocal 0 .............................. <volym>
  [ 25] pushint8 10 ............................. <10>
  [ 27] sub ..................................... <volym - 10>
  [ 28] setlocal 0 .............................. volym = volym - 10
  [ 30] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [ 32] getlocal 0 .............................. <volym>
  [ 34] pusharglist 1 ........................... <volym>
  [ 36] extcall 73 .............................. <integer(volym)>
  [ 38] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 40] set 4 ................................... set the volume of sound 2 to integer(volym)
  [ 42] pushint8 6 .............................. <6>
  [ 44] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <6>
  [ 46] extcall 75 .............................. Wait(6)
  [ 48] endrepeat [ 16]
  [ 50] pushsymb 80 ............................. <#stop>
  [ 52] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [ 54] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <2>
  [ 56] extcall 81 .............................. sound stop 2
  [ 58] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 60] extcall 82 .............................. unloadMember()
  [ 62] pushint8 4 .............................. <4>
  [ 64] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <4>
  [ 66] extcall 55 .............................. cursor(4)
  [ 68] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 70] pushcons 0 .............................. <"kalender">
  [ 72] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <1, "kalender">
  [ 74] extcall 46 .............................. go(1, "kalender")
  [ 76] ret
end
